        <SubtypeId>ArcanePower_Thermal_CO2HpStraightBare</SubtypeId>
      </Id>
      <DisplayName>Arcane CO₂_HP Straight Pipe (Bare)</DisplayName>
      <Icon>Textures/GUI/Icons/ArcanePower/Thermal/ArcanePower_Thermal_CO2HpStraightBare.dds</Icon>
      <Description>Closed-loop thermal CO2_HP / Straight bare. Match typed socket faces and H/C roll on one physical large grid. Use the placement guide and cap unused sockets. The reactor supplies its own CO2; ordinary conveyors do not replace thermal pipes.</Description>
